sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as New Intranet Source
    participant C as Intranet Connector
    participant R as Cloud Integration Receiver
    participant I as Integration Inbox
    participant U as Unified Ticket Core
    participant O as Integration Outbox

    S->>C: New service request / alert / identity event
    C->>C: Validate, sign, persist local cursor/spool
    C->>R: Outbound mTLS event batch
    R->>I: Store by source + external_event_id
    I->>I: Authenticate, schema-check, idempotency
    I->>U: Create Intake or perform authorized Ticket Action
    U->>U: Ticket + append-only Event + Outbox transaction
    U->>O: Create source projection intent
    O->>C: Status projection / acknowledgement
    C->>S: Update source-visible projection when supported
    C->>C: Commit cursor after acknowledgement

    Note over I,U: External source never owns Ticket status
    Note over C,U: No historical Ticket import path exists in V1.4
